// Ch1 C1-05 "The low lights": the gallery ends at a stairwell going down into the dark, barred by a
// diver's knotted cord, a hundred knots, some new. Held motes (glimmer_held, cyan) drift sideways and
// DOWN the stairwell, sinking past the lantern's reach. The light grammar's first lesson, given
// without a word about it: cyan light that sinks is wrong. U06 is locked at the lip.
// Watches: Rhen is never drawn toward them and nothing calls him. No bound light appears in Ch1.
title: ch01_low_lights
location: ch01/oruvel_underway
---
@camera U06
@vfx glimmer_held at=stair_down count=24 drift=down_seaward rate=slow
@wait 2.5
@anim rhen touch_cord
Rhen [worried]: Nobody goes below the ninth floor. #line:ch01_low_001
Rhen [neutral]: You don't follow the low lights. #line:ch01_low_002
@wait 1.0
Narrator(rhen) [neutral]: Every diver in Oruvel was taught that. Nobody ever told us why. #line:ch01_low_003 #vo
@wait 1.5
@camera release
===
